public class WordDictionary{class N{public N[]c=new N[26];public bool end;}N r=new();public WordDictionary(){}public void AddWord(string s){N p=r;foreach(char x in s){int k=x-'a';if(p.c[k]==null)p.c[k]=new N();p=p.c[k];}p.end=true;}bool F(N p,string s,int i){if(p==null)return false;if(i==s.Length)return p.end;if(s[i]=='.'){foreach(var x in p.c)if(F(x,s,i+1))return true;return false;}return F(p.c[s[i]-'a'],s,i+1);}public bool Search(string s)=>F(r,s,0);}
